## 2. Task Table  

| **Name** | **Title** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** | **Justification** |
|----------|-----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|-------------------|
| AT1 | Navigate to Kitchen | Robot moves from its current location to the kitchen. | AND | kitchen | 1 | Robot must physically reach the kitchen before picking up meals. |
| AT2 | Pick Up Meals | Robot picks up the requested meals from the kitchen. | AND | kitchen | 1 | Directly follows navigation. |
| AT3 | Navigate to Patient Room | Robot moves to the patient’s room. | AND | patient room | 1 | Required before delivery. |
| AT4 | Place Food on Table | Robot places the meal on the patient’s table. | AND | patient room table | 1 | One of the acceptable delivery modes. |
| AT5 | Place Food on Tray | Robot places the meal on a tray for patient retrieval. | AND | patient room | 1 | Needed when table delivery is not chosen. |
| AT6 | Signal Patient of Meal | Robot signals the patient that the meal is ready for retrieval. | AND | patient room | 1 | Enables patient retrieval mode. |
| AT7 | Wait for Patient Retrieval | Robot waits for the patient to retrieve the meal. | AND | patient room | 1 | Ensures meal is actually taken. |
| AT8 | Open Door Unassisted | Robot opens the patient room door by itself. | AND | room door | 1 | Possible if door is easy to open. |
| AT9 | Open Door with Human | Robot cooperates with a human to open the door. | AND | room door | 1 (robot) + human | Human may be needed for heavy doors. |
| AT10 | Open Door with Robot | Two robots cooperate to open the door. | AND | room door | 2 | For doors requiring more force. |
| AT11 | Collect Dishes Unassisted | Robot collects dirty dishes alone. | AND | patient room | 1 | If robot can reach all dishes. |
| AT12 | Collect Dishes with Human | Robot cooperates with a human to collect dishes. | AND | patient room | 1 (robot) + human | Human may help with bulky dishes. |
| AT13 | Collect Dishes with Robot | Two robots cooperate to collect dishes. | AND | patient room | 2 | For large amounts of dishes. |
| AT14 | Human Assistance Retrieval of Food | Robot cooperates with a human to retrieve food from the tray. | AND | patient room | 1 (robot) + human | If patient cannot retrieve. |
| AT15 | Robot Assistance Retrieval of Food | Two robots cooperate to retrieve food from the tray. | AND | patient room | 2 | If no human help is available. |
| AT16 | Query Patient Retrieval Ability | Robot queries the patient record to determine if patient can retrieve food. | AND | hospital database | 1 | Needed to decide retrieval method. |
| AT17 | Query Companion Presence | Robot queries the database to check for a companion in the room. | AND | hospital database | 1 | Determines if human assistance is possible. |
| AT18 | Query Nurse Availability | Robot queries the nurse scheduling system. | AND | nurse scheduling system | 1 | Determines if nurse can help. |

